ildren":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:17"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"limit","children":[{"type":"text","value":"limit"}]},{"type":"code","value":"limit: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L16","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:16"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"offending","children":[{"type":"text","value":"offending"}]},{"type":"code","value":"offending: string[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L19","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:19"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"path","children":[{"type":"text","value":"path"}]},{"type":"code","value":"path: \"native\" | \"portable\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L15","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:15"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"provider","children":[{"type":"text","value":"provider"}]},{"type":"code","value":"provider: \"anthropic\" | \"openai\" | \"gemini\" | \"other\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L14","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:14"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"actual","text":"actual","level":3},{"id":"allowed","text":"allowed","level":3},{"id":"limit","text":"limit","level":3},{"id":"offending","text":"offending","level":3},{"id":"path","text":"path","level":3},{"id":"provider","text":"provider","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:13](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L13)\n\nThrown when a skills request exceeds a provider limit. Lives in core (rather\nthan `@tanstack/ai-skills`) so the native tool factories in `ai-anthropic`\nand `openai-base` can throw it without depending on the skills package;\n`@tanstack/ai-skills` re-exports it for the portable path.\n\n`path` distinguishes the native provider cap (e.g. Anthropic's 8-skill\nlimit) from a portable-path limit, so a portable user isn't sent chasing a\ncap that only applies to hosted skills.\n\n## Properties\n\n### actual\n\n```ts\nactual: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:18](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L18)\n\n***\n\n### allowed\n\n```ts\nallowed: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:17](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L17)\n\n***\n\n### limit\n\n```ts\nlimit: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L16)\n\n***\n\n### offending\n\n```ts\noffending: string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:19](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L19)\n\n***\n\n### path\n\n```ts\npath: \"native\" | \"portable\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L15)\n\n***\n\n### provider\n\n```ts\nprovider: \"anthropic\" | \"openai\" | \"gemini\" | \"other\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:14](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L14)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SkillLimitErrorInit\ntitle: SkillLimitErrorInit\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:13](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L13)\n\nThrown when a skills request exceeds a provider limit. Lives in core (rather\nthan `@tanstack/ai-skills`) so the native tool factories in `ai-anthropic`\nand `openai-base` can throw it without depending on the skills package;\n`@tanstack/ai-skills` re-exports it for the portable path.\n\n`path` distinguishes the native provider cap (e.g. Anthropic's 8-skill\nlimit) from a portable-path limit, so a portable user isn't sent chasing a\ncap that only applies to hosted skills.\n\n## Properties\n\n### actual\n\n```ts\nactual: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:18](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L18)\n\n***\n\n### allowed\n\n```ts\nallowed: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:17](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L17)\n\n***\n\n### limit\n\n```ts\nlimit: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L16)\n\n***\n\n### offending\n\n```ts\noffending: string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:19](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L19)\n\n***\n\n### path\n\n```ts\npath: \"native\" | \"portable\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:15](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L15)\n\n***\n\n### provider\n\n```ts\nprovider: \"anthropic\" | \"openai\" | \"gemini\" | \"other\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts:14](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/errors.ts#L14)\n"}
